.Dd June 24, 2026
.Dt LIBCLOCALE 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm libclocale.h
.Nd Library to support cross-platform C locale functions
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In libclocale.h
.Pp
Support functions
.nf
.Ft const char *
.Fo libclocale_get_version
.Fa "void"
.Fc
.fi
.nf
.Ft int
.Fo libclocale_initialize
.Fa "const char *domain_name"
.Fa "libclocale_error_t **error"
.Fc
.fi
.Pp
Codepage functions
.nf
.Ft int
.Fo libclocale_codepage_get
.Fa "int *codepage"
.Fa "libclocale_error_t **error"
.Fc
.fi
.nf
.Ft int
.Fo libclocale_codepage_set
.Fa "int codepage"
.Fa "libclocale_error_t **error"
.Fc
.fi
.nf
.Ft int
.Fo libclocale_codepage_copy_from_string
.Fa "int *codepage"
.Fa "const char *string"
.Fa "size_t string_length"
.Fa "uint32_t feature_flags"
.Fa "libclocale_error_t **error"
.Fc
.fi
.Pp
Available when compiled with wide character string support:
.nf
.Ft int
.Fo libclocale_codepage_copy_from_string_wide
.Fa "int *codepage"
.Fa "const wchar_t *string"
.Fa "size_t string_length"
.Fa "uint32_t feature_flags"
.Fa "libclocale_error_t **error"
.Fc
.fi
.Pp
Locale functions
.nf
.Ft int
.Fo libclocale_locale_get_codepage
.Fa "int *codepage"
.Fa "libclocale_error_t **error"
.Fc
.fi
.nf
.Ft int
.Fo libclocale_locale_get_decimal_point
.Fa "int *decimal_point"
.Fa "libclocale_error_t **error"
.Fc
.fi
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn libclocale_get_version
function is used to retrieve the library version.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Most of the functions return NULL or \-1 on error, dependent on the return \
type.
For the actual return values see
.In libclocale.h .
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
None
.Sh FILES
None
.Sh NOTES
libclocale can be compiled with wide character support (wchar_t).
.sp
To compile libclocale with wide character support use:
.Ar ./configure --enable-wide-character-type
 or define:
.Ar _UNICODE
 or
.Ar UNICODE
 during compilation.
.sp
.Ar LIBCLOCALE_WIDE_CHARACTER_TYPE
 in libclocale/features.h can be used to determine if libclocale was compiled with \
wide character support.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.In libclocale.h
